{"unit_id": "Locietta__dsh-rewind-retry#feature-1", "repo": "Locietta/dsh-rewind-retry", "commit": "aca3e6584a7a7353b83632d6b047f8462d1f2786", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-rewind-retry 的功能「重试提示词」：为用户发起的已结束轮次创建会话分支，并在分支中重新发送原提示词文本。点击轮次操作栏的重试按钮触发；带附件时会把文本暂存到输入框并提示重新添加附件。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:240"]}
{"unit_id": "Locietta__dsh-rewind-retry#feature-2", "repo": "Locietta/dsh-rewind-retry", "commit": "aca3e6584a7a7353b83632d6b047f8462d1f2786", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-rewind-retry 的功能「编辑提示词」：在原提示词之前分叉会话，并将提示词放入新分支的输入框，供用户修改后发送。点击已结束用户轮次的编辑按钮触发。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:240"]}
{"unit_id": "Locietta__dsh-rewind-retry#feature-3", "repo": "Locietta/dsh-rewind-retry", "commit": "aca3e6584a7a7353b83632d6b047f8462d1f2786", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-rewind-retry 的功能「继续中断轮次」：在最新失败或没有回复的轮次中，向当前会话发送固定的继续提示，保留已有会话工作。通过轮次尾部的继续按钮触发。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:526"]}
{"unit_id": "Locietta__dsh-rewind-retry#card-zh", "repo": "Locietta/dsh-rewind-retry", "commit": "aca3e6584a7a7353b83632d6b047f8462d1f2786", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-rewind-retry 为 DSH Web 聊天增加已结束轮次的重试、编辑和继续操作。插件在对话操作栏或轮次尾部显示按钮：重试会在原提示词前分叉会话并重新发送文本；编辑会分叉并把提示词放入新会话输入框；继续可恢复最新失败或无回复的轮次。原会话保留为独立分支。适合需要修正提示词或恢复中断对话的 DSH 用户。无需额外密钥或外部服务；附件需手动重新添加。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:240", "client.js:526"]}
{"unit_id": "Locietta__dsh-rewind-retry#card-en", "repo": "Locietta/dsh-rewind-retry", "commit": "aca3e6584a7a7353b83632d6b047f8462d1f2786", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "dsh-rewind-retry adds retry, edit, and continue to finished DSH Web turns. Retry forks before a prompt and resends it; Edit forks and stages it in a new composer; Continue resumes the latest failed or reply-less turn. The original session stays intact. No key is needed; reattach files.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:240", "client.js:526"]}
